usage: ccfix_audit.py [-h] [--error-callees] pre post output

Offline PRE/POST function-byte inventory. No listeners or workloads are
started.

positional arguments:
  pre
  post
  output

options:
  -h, --help       show this help message and exit
  --error-callees  admit append -> append_error relocation on error-only
                   producers
